{
  "v": 2,
  "label": "Value Semantics — 1.0 tail",
  "order": 40,
  "nodes": [
    {"id":"hdr","type":"NoteNode","x":-40,"y":-300,"init":{"label":"Value-semantics tail (2026-07-05)","body":"The changes from this build pass, each wired through a **Display** (which shows the value or a red error badge). Overflow/domain errors, IFS/SWITCH #N/A, out-of-range CHOOSE, per-cell list errors, muted default placeholders, and 15-digit number→text. Hover any badge for the reason.","color":"blue","width":900,"height":190}},

    {"id":"nA","type":"NoteNode","x":-40,"y":-40,"init":{"label":"Non-finite guard","body":"A computation never leaves a bare NaN/∞ — it's classified. A finite-input result too big → **#OVERFLOW!**; an undefined result (√ of a negative) → **#DOMAIN!**.","color":"vermilion","width":230,"height":150}},
    {"id":"p_ovf","type":"ArithmeticNode","x":300,"y":-40,"init":{"label":"10 ^ 400  →  #OVERFLOW!","op":"pow"},"literals":{"a":10,"b":400}},
    {"id":"d_ovf","type":"DisplayNode","x":620,"y":-40,"init":{"label":"Display"}},
    {"id":"p_dom","type":"MathFnNode","x":300,"y":150,"init":{"label":"√(−4)  →  #DOMAIN!","op":"sqrt"},"literals":{"in":-4}},
    {"id":"d_dom","type":"DisplayNode","x":620,"y":150,"init":{"label":"Display"}},

    {"id":"nB","type":"NoteNode","x":-40,"y":360,"init":{"label":"Per-cell errors in a list","body":"An element that fails carries its OWN error, in place — 20 ÷ 0 → #DIV/0! at that cell only, the rest compute. `[10,20,30] ÷ [2,0,5]` → `[5, #DIV/0!, 6]`.","color":"gold","width":230,"height":160}},
    {"id":"la","type":"ListInputNode","x":300,"y":330,"init":{"label":"[10, 20, 30]","valueKeys":["v0","v1","v2"]},"stringLiterals":{"v0":"10","v1":"20","v2":"30"}},
    {"id":"lb","type":"ListInputNode","x":300,"y":470,"init":{"label":"[2, 0, 5]","valueKeys":["v0","v1","v2"]},"stringLiterals":{"v0":"2","v1":"0","v2":"5"}},
    {"id":"p_cell","type":"ArithmeticNode","x":620,"y":400,"init":{"label":"list ÷ list","op":"div"}},
    {"id":"d_cell","type":"DisplayNode","x":900,"y":400,"init":{"label":"Display"}},

    {"id":"nC","type":"NoteNode","x":-40,"y":720,"init":{"label":"No-match → #N/A, not a silent blank","body":"An IFS/SWITCH with no matching case and an EMPTY fallback is a logic hole → a loud, catchable **#N/A** (note the muted `N/A` placeholder in the empty Otherwise/Default box). A CHOOSE index out of range → **#VALUE!**.","color":"purple","width":230,"height":200}},
    {"id":"p_ifs","type":"IfsNode","x":300,"y":700,"init":{"label":"IFS — all false, no Otherwise","valueKeys":["cond0","val0","cond1","val1","cond2","val2"]},"literals":{"cond0":0,"val0":10,"cond1":0,"val1":20,"cond2":0,"val2":30}},
    {"id":"d_ifs","type":"DisplayNode","x":620,"y":700,"init":{"label":"Display"}},
    {"id":"p_sw","type":"SwitchNode","x":300,"y":1010,"init":{"label":"SWITCH — no match, no Default","valueKeys":["when0","then0","when1","then1","when2","then2"]},"literals":{"expr":99,"when0":1,"then0":10,"when1":2,"then1":20,"when2":3,"then2":30}},
    {"id":"d_sw","type":"DisplayNode","x":620,"y":1010,"init":{"label":"Display"}},
    {"id":"p_ch","type":"ChooseNode","x":300,"y":1390,"init":{"label":"CHOOSE #99 of 4","valueKeys":["v0","v1","v2","v3"]},"literals":{"index":99,"v0":10,"v1":20,"v2":30,"v3":40}},
    {"id":"d_ch","type":"DisplayNode","x":620,"y":1390,"init":{"label":"Display"}},

    {"id":"nD","type":"NoteNode","x":-40,"y":1700,"init":{"label":"Defaults as muted placeholders","body":"A `(default X)` input shows X as a MUTED placeholder in the empty box, not as label prose — blank means \"use the default\". RANDARRAY min/max (0/1), SEQUENCE start/step (1), FIXED decimals (2), NUMBERVALUE separators (. and ,).","color":"gold","width":230,"height":200}},
    {"id":"ra","type":"RandArrayNode","x":300,"y":1700,"init":{"label":"RANDARRAY — min/max blank"},"literals":{"count":5}},
    {"id":"sq","type":"SequenceNode","x":520,"y":1700,"init":{"label":"SEQUENCE — start/step blank"},"literals":{"count":5}},
    {"id":"fx","type":"FixedNode","x":740,"y":1700,"init":{"label":"FIXED — decimals blank"},"literals":{"number":3.14159}},
    {"id":"nv","type":"NumberValueNode","x":300,"y":1950,"init":{"label":"NUMBERVALUE — sep fields blank"},"stringLiterals":{"text":"1,234.5"}},
    {"id":"d_nv","type":"DisplayNode","x":620,"y":1950,"init":{"label":"Display  →  1234.5"}},

    {"id":"nE","type":"NoteNode","x":-40,"y":2200,"init":{"label":"Number → text at 15 digits","body":"Printing a number into text no longer leaks IEEE noise: `(0.1+0.2) & \" kg\"` is `\"0.3 kg\"`, not `\"0.30000000000000004 kg\"`.","color":"lime","width":230,"height":150}},
    {"id":"p_txt","type":"ExpressionNode","x":300,"y":2200,"init":{"label":"(0.1 + 0.2) & \" kg\"","expr":"(0.1 + 0.2) & \" kg\"","resultAs":"text"}},
    {"id":"d_txt","type":"DisplayNode","x":620,"y":2200,"init":{"label":"Display"}},

    {"id":"nF","type":"NoteNode","x":-40,"y":2430,"init":{"label":"NaN is dirty DATA, not an error","body":"A COMPUTATION can't make a bare NaN anymore (those are #OVERFLOW! / #DOMAIN!). NaN only arrives as dirty imported data — here a **number** column whose middle cell is the junk value `oops` (what a broken CSV import leaves behind). It coerces to NaN, shows as a quiet muted **NaN** in the frame cell, and summing the column carries it to a muted scalar NaN — never the old lie \"N/A\", never a red error badge.","color":"gray","width":230,"height":220}},
    {"id":"fi_nan","type":"FrameInputNode","x":300,"y":2430,"init":{"label":"reading — a bad cell","frameText":"[{\"name\":\"reading\",\"type\":\"number\",\"cells\":[\"1\",\"oops\",\"3\"]}]"}},
    {"id":"d_fnan","type":"DisplayNode","x":560,"y":2430,"init":{"label":"Frame — NaN in the cell"}},
    {"id":"gc_nan","type":"GetColumnNode","x":300,"y":2660,"init":{"label":"Get \"reading\"","readAs":"number"},"stringLiterals":{"name":"reading"}},
    {"id":"ag_nan","type":"AggregateNode","x":560,"y":2660,"init":{"label":"SUM","op":"sum"}},
    {"id":"d_snan","type":"DisplayNode","x":820,"y":2660,"init":{"label":"scalar → muted NaN"}}
  ],
